You could install Dropbox on your server and use a shared Dropbox folder. Dropbox supposedly tracks changes to files so even if they mess something up you should be able to get it back.

https://www.dropbox.com/help/11/en
https://www.dropbox.com/install?os=lnx

This is inferior to some combination of GitHub/rsync/ssh (plus some shell scripts to hide the complexity from your collaborators) but if you are that against doing it that way then this seems like it should work.

